<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2026-11 on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2026-11/</link><description>Recent content in 2026-11 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2026-11/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>VCF MAF 변환 작업 #1 도커 연결, 레퍼런스 세팅, 배치 실행</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om1/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="vcf-maf-변환-작업-1-도커-연결-레퍼런스-세팅-배치-실행"&gt;&#10; VCF MAF 변환 작업 #1 도커 연결, 레퍼런스 세팅, 배치 실행&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#vcf-maf-%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-1-%eb%8f%84%ec%bb%a4-%ec%97%b0%ea%b2%b0-%eb%a0%88%ed%8d%bc%eb%9f%b0%ec%8a%a4-%ec%84%b8%ed%8c%85-%eb%b0%b0%ec%b9%98-%ec%8b%a4%ed%96%89"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-04&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 1. VEP cache 다운로드&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\r&lt;/span&gt;eferences&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\v&lt;/span&gt;ep&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;curl.exe -L -C - -o homo_sapiens_vep_116_GRCh37.tar.gz https://ftp.ensembl.org/pub/grch37/release-116/variation/indexed_vep_cache/homo_sapiens_vep_116_GRCh37.tar.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 압축 풀기&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;tar -xzf homo_sapiens_vep_116_GRCh37.tar.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;ls .&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\h&lt;/span&gt;omo_sapiens&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 2. hg19 FASTA 다운로드&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\r&lt;/span&gt;eferences&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\g&lt;/span&gt;rch37&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;curl.exe -L -C - -o hg19.fa.gz https://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg19/bigZips/hg19.fa.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 3. 도커 연결&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;$env:Path +&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;;C:\Program Files\Docker\Docker\resources\bin&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;$IMG &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;ghcr.io/ncdcbioinformatics/cure-ngs-harmonizer:0.2.5&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 4. FASTA 압축 해제 .fai 인덱스 생성&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references:/references&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --entrypoint gunzip $IMG -k /references/grch37/hg19.fa.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references:/references&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --entrypoint samtools $IMG faidx /references/grch37/hg19.fa&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# .dict 생성&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references:/references&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --entrypoint java $IMG -jar /opt/picard/picard.jar CreateSequenceDictionary R&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/references/grch37/hg19.fa O&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/references/grch37/hg19.dict&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 결과 확인&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;ls C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\r&lt;/span&gt;eferences&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\g&lt;/span&gt;rch37&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 디렉터리: C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references\grch37&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Mode LastWriteTime Length Name &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;---- ------------- ------ ---- &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-29 오전 9:15 9515 hg19.dict &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-23 오전 10:00 3199905909 hg19.fa &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-29 오전 9:14 3539 hg19.fa.fai &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-23 오전 10:00 948731419 hg19.fa.gz &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;hg19.fa(3.2 GB), hg19.fa.fai, hg19.dict 3개 파일이 생성됨.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>VCF MAF 변환 작업 #2</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om2/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="vcf-maf-변환-작업-2"&gt;&#10; VCF MAF 변환 작업 #2&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#vcf-maf-%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-2"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-04&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;NCDC_batch_vcf2maf_V.1.3.3_github.sh 파일을 확인해본 결과이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 1. user config&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;CORES&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;SAMPLE_TAG_LENGTH&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Tumor_Sample_Barcode length (e.g., 8 → &amp;#34;S002-033&amp;#34;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;INPUT_DIR&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/path/VCF_ALL&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;OUT_MAF&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/path/VCF_ALL_MAF&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;GRCH37_FASTAS&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=(&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.../hg19.fa&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.../Homo_sapiens_assembly19.fasta&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.../102_GRCh37/Homo_sapiens.GRCh37.dna.toplevel.fa&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;VCF2MAF_EXTRA_OPTS_GRCH37&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;--species homo_sapiens --ncbi-build GRCh37&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;병렬 개수, 샘플 ID 길이, 입출력 폴더, vcf2maf/VEP 위치, GRCh37 FASTA 3종을 지정한다. 실패하면 다른 fasta를 사용해서 돌리는것이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;경로에 102_GRCh37, 뒤쪽 106행에 ensembl-vep-release-102가 보이는데, 원래 작업 환경이 VEP 102였다는 뜻이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 2. 레퍼런스 자동 탐색&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;resolve_reference_paths()가 설정한 경로에 파일이 없으면 SEARCH_ROOTS 아래를 find로 뒤져서 hg19.fa, chain 파일, homo_sapiens 폴더 등을 찾는다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>데이터 준비 (01)</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs23/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs23/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="데이터-준비-01"&gt;&#10; 데이터 준비 (01)&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0-%ec%a4%80%eb%b9%84-01"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-02&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-gdc-파일-목록과-코호트"&gt;&#10; 1. GDC 파일 목록과 코호트&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-gdc-%ed%8c%8c%ec%9d%bc-%eb%aa%a9%eb%a1%9d%ea%b3%bc-%ec%bd%94%ed%98%b8%ed%8a%b8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;GDC API로 TCGA-LUAD·LUSC의 파일 목록(RNA, miRNA, 변이, RPPA, 450K 메틸화, 진단용 슬라이드)을 받아 환자별 보유 자료를 정리하고 코호트를 정했다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;원발 종양 자료가 있는 환자: LUAD 571, LUSC 504&#10;코호트 (DX 슬라이드 + RNA): LUAD 474, LUSC 476&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;병리 이미지 분석과 오믹스 분석이 같은 환자에서 이뤄지도록 코호트를 DX 슬라이드와 RNA를 모두 가진 환자로 정하였다. RNA는 있으나 DX 슬라이드가 없는 환자(LUAD 43명, LUSC 25명)는 제외되었다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>연구 정리 (01)</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs24/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs24/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="연구-정리-01"&gt;&#10; 연구 정리 (01)&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%97%b0%ea%b5%ac-%ec%a0%95%eb%a6%ac-01"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-02&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-gdc-파일-목록과-코호트"&gt;&#10; 1. GDC 파일 목록과 코호트&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-gdc-%ed%8c%8c%ec%9d%bc-%eb%aa%a9%eb%a1%9d%ea%b3%bc-%ec%bd%94%ed%98%b8%ed%8a%b8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;입력 크기 파일 최초 출처&#10;GDC 파일 목록 조회 9,793행 (GDC API 응답) GDC API files 엔드포인트, TCGA-LUAD·LUSC&#10; 자료형: Gene Expression Quantification,&#10; miRNA Expression Quantification,&#10; Masked Somatic Mutation,&#10; Protein Expression Quantification,&#10; Methylation Beta Value, Slide Image&#10;&#10;출력 크기 파일 내용&#10;GDC 파일 목록 9,793행 × 13열 data\manifest\gdc_files.csv 파일 × 환자 × 표본 한 줄 (파일 ID, 이름, 크기,&#10; md5, 자료형, 플랫폼, 실험 방식, 워크플로,&#10; 조직형, 환자·표본 바코드, 표본 유형, 층)&#10;코호트 950명 data\manifest\cohort.csv DX 슬라이드와 원발 종양 RNA를 모두 가진 환자,&#10; 층별 보유 여부&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;분석 대상을 처음부터 하나의 기준으로 정해야 이후 모든 단계의 환자가 일치한다. 특히 이 연구는 병리 이미지와 오믹스를 함께 다루므로, 두 자료를 모두 가진 환자를 코호트로 정할 필요가 있다. GDC API로 TCGA-LUAD·LUSC의 RNA, miRNA, 체세포 변이, RPPA, DNA 메틸화, 병리 슬라이드 파일 목록을 조회하였다(9,793행; 한 파일이 종양·정상 표본에 함께 걸리면 표본마다 한 행). 이 중 진단용 FFPE 슬라이드(DX)만 병리 이미지로 사용하고 동결 절편 슬라이드는 제외하였으며, 메틸화는 450K 플랫폼만 남겼다. 원발 종양 표본 기준으로 하나 이상의 자료를 가진 환자는 LUAD 571명, LUSC 504명이었다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>폐암 데이터셋</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs22/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs22/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="폐암-데이터셋"&gt;&#10; 폐암 데이터셋&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8f%90%ec%95%94-%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0%ec%85%8b"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;전체 {&amp;#39;LUAD&amp;#39;: 584, &amp;#39;LUSC&amp;#39;: 504} → 코호트(RNA) {&amp;#39;LUAD&amp;#39;: 517, &amp;#39;LUSC&amp;#39;: 501}&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;TCGA-LUAD, LUSC에서 각각 584장, 504장을 다운로드하였다. 분석 코호트는 RNA가 존재하는 517+501명을 사용하였다. (다운로드 방식: GDC API)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; LUAD LUSC&#10;MAF 465 463&#10;Meth 414 347&#10;RNA 474 476&#10;RPPA 328 304&#10;miRNA 467 460&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;GDC 포털에서 5가지 오믹스를 다운받았다. 데이터가 존재하는 대상자는 이와 같다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;LUAD: 환자 414 | 탐침 486,427 → cg·마스크·성염색체 442,243 → 결측 400,772 | 대체 0.53%&#10;LUSC: 환자 347 | 탐침 486,427 → cg·마스크·성염색체 442,243 → 결측 397,085 | 대체 0.77%&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;메틸레이션 데이터는 QC를 해줬고&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>